  "local_changes": [
    "pipeline.js: collect cutTimes only when audioStrip is enabled; Bines disables the strip, so its unused lifetime history cannot grow. The bridge clears the exposed diagnostic log after every frame.",
    "pipeline.js: cap future-frame lookahead at ceil(cutFutureDelay * fps) + 2 (at least 2) frames, dropping oldest pending candidates when producers exceed the configured rate; keeps capture queues bounded even with duplicate or dense timestamps.",
    "sheet.js: remove decorative bars from unused layout cells; empty padding is not captured application content and must not resemble a loading indicator.",
    "pipeline.js: add optional fixed grid3 chronological 3x3 rendering with a nine-frame cap, empty tail cells, precise source timestamps, explicit capture wall time and matching flush/finish paths. Bridge exposes acknowledged finite-frame processing and drain without replay queue loss or duplicate tail frames."
